  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0\n\t\t\t⭐ add mechanism for specifying field arguments as part of the fluent syntax with AddArguments()\n\t\t\t⭐ extend alias syntax to a wider range of elements, including Lists and Enums\n\t\t\t🧹general code tidy\n\n\t\t\tv1.1.2\n\t\t\t🐛 string extension methods should be internal to avoid collisions with other libraries\n\n\t\t\tv1.1.1\n\t\t\t🐛 add argument support for Lists\n\t\t\t🐛 boolean conditions should render \"true\" not \"True\", and \"false\" not \"False\"\n\t\t\t🐛 add FragmentReference to behave like a field rather than a transparent type conversion\n\n\t\t\tv1.1.0\n\t\t\t✔️ Add validation for labels/aliases\n\t\t\t✔️ Add automatic grouping of operations with the same TypeName + Alias + Arguments\n\t\t\t   > This makes is easier to construct complex queries in a series of steps and simplifies the output as much as possible\n\t\t\t🐛 Bugfix for multi-operation queries",
